# This computer's own settings for the laptop wall (Start IXG Wall.cmd / npm run wall):
# copy this file to local.env beside it. local.env is never committed (.gitignore).
# The launcher (and npm run wall) hand it to the backend; anything already set in the
# environment comes first.

# Sign-in on this wall (optional). Admins sign in with this password and hand out user
# links (Settings -> User links); without it, everyone who opens the wall is an admin.
# Changing it signs everyone out. Keep the file private.
IXG_PASSWORD=
